<title>USA: U.S. Trust Corp Q1 share rises.</title>
<headline>U.S. Trust Corp Q1 share rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.55		    $0.46</p>
<p> Net			 11,921		    9,597</p>
<p> Total revs		88,453		   77,423</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share figures reflect a two-for-one stock split distributed on Feb 21. Total fee revenue for Q1 '97 was $66.7 million vs $58.0 million in Q1 '96.</p>
<p>Net interest revenue after the provision for credit losses was $21.7 million in Q1 '97 vs $19.2 million in the year ago period.</p>
<p>During the first quarter, the company said it acquired 221,090 shares of common stock under its repurchase program.</p>
